00:05:13,220 --> 00:05:19,660
And so that's kind of what he talks about through the rest of the, the paper is this concept of substates and how to hit those.

54
00:05:20,300 --> 00:05:37,860
And due to race conditions being very tricky with, you know, distance between you to the target server and just, you know, the, the sequential nature of HTTP 1.1, race conditions have been very challenging.

